5,1,1,talk,Servas,,The money is easy to find. The people are the true measure of a project’s worth.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Ooh, I bet the ledgers hide a funny secret! I want to peek at the travel and bench-fee lines to see who pays what.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I am a bit nervous. I want to check the closeout files to see what actually finished.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I am tired of projects dying from outside noise. I will check the incident logs on shared instrumentation to see where work actually stops.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,Shared services are the real bottleneck. I will check the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities to see if they can handle the load.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
