35,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The technicians are gone, but the glasshouse crew remains strong. I will check the staffing rolls and the minutes on secondments.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Sakura,,- **Sakura**: Wow! The bench-fee subsidy is a lifesaver for glasshouses! But shipping costs are climbing. I wonder who pays for that now?,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I found that catalogue awards still draw users a decade later, while mechanism ones stalled. I also saw live breeding causes double the schedule overruns.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,The spectroscopy suite sat idle for eleven weeks! That is unacceptable. I will not let broken equipment kill our science.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minako,,"The animal facility is accredited, but day rates jumped sharply. The glasshouse is fully booked. I need to see how this affects the candidates.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Sakura, the subsidy helps, but the glasshouse is already full. We must respect the crew’s limits.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Servas, that is tricky! If the glasshouse is full, maybe we should look at indoor labs? I am checking the repository speed now.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Takumi, the idle suite is worrying. I am still processing the closeout data. It feels heavy to trust instinct again.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Daisuke, the field sites lost whole seasons to flooding. That is not science, that is bad luck. I refuse to fund a project that can be stopped by rain.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Takumi, weather is a risk, but the animal facility costs are the real shock. The accreditation is solid, yet the day rates are punishing.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Daisuke, the closeout data is clear. Live breeding doubles the delays. We must avoid that trap.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Daisuke, that is scary! But my repository news is great. Data saves in weeks now, not years. That is a huge win for everyone!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Sakura, that is good news. It means the data will actually be useful later. I am glad something is working well.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Minako, the indoor holding rooms ran uninterrupted while field sites drowned. I will not gamble on weather. We need stability, not luck.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minako,,"@Takumi, I agree. Stability is key. But the computing agreement makes simulation free. That is a major cost advantage we cannot ignore.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,"The modelling analysts are gone, but the glasshouse crew stands firm. We must build on what remains, not what we wish for.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"@Minako, free computing is amazing! But I am still worried about who pays for the extra shipping now. The ledgers are confusing!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I am glad the data is saving us. I just need to trust the records, not my gut.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, the crew is strong, but the equipment is broken. We need a project that does not depend on the idle suite.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minako,,"@Servas, the crew is strong, but the animal costs are a barrier. We must pick a project that fits the current capacity, not the ideal.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
