66,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Servas, exactly! And since the bench-fee subsidy covers the glasshouse, the awardee saves a lot. I am voting for D!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Sakura, I agree. The records show D avoids the breeding delays and the broken suite. I am voting for D.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Daisuke, I agree. D is indoor and stable. It avoids the field risks and broken equipment. I am voting for D.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Daisuke, I agree. D fits the current capacity perfectly. The glasshouse is booked, but the crew is strong. I am voting for D.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Servas,,"The hands are here, the tools are ready, and the path is clear. I am ready to vote for D.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Sakura,,"I am voting for D! The subsidy makes it affordable, and the fast data saving is a bonus. Let us pick the winner!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I am voting for D. The records show it is the safest choice. I trust the data over my own doubts.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Takumi,,"I am voting for D. It is stable, the crew is ready, and it avoids the broken equipment. No more surprises.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Minako,,I am voting for D. It aligns with the available capacity and avoids the cost shocks we identified. The data supports this choice.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Servas,,"D is our choice. The crew is ready, the path is clear, and the future is bright. Let us begin.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
